  "solution": "By solving each option,\n\n**1) 14 and 22, ****– ****and ****×**\n\n**→ 14 × 11 – 22 + 24 ÷ 8 = 154 – 22 + 3 = 154 - 19 = 135**\n\n2) 22 and 14, + and ÷\n\n→ 14 – 11 × 22 ÷ 24 + 8 = 14 – 11 × 0.91 + 8 ≠ 135\n\n3) 22 and 11, + and –\n\n→ 11 + 22 × 14 – 24 ÷ 8 = 11 + 308 – 3 = 316 ≠ 135\n\n4) 24 and 22, + and ÷\n\n→ 24 – 11 × 14 ÷ 22 + 8 = 24 – 11 × 0.63 + 8 ≠ 135\n\nHence, by interchanging “14 and 22, – and ×” we get the correct answer.",
